#: scenario7:scenario7_99EEECE2_ECCA_47E9_9341_77F7239EB190
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 810df3cfe8978c1e376391a5cae789c14d55a9d95c3bbf8ee0afcfaf5dc30da9
#. default-sha256: 1a5be12c01378a774b405fa30a17030b9e7757e97ba2fbe38f6994e36f98a8ae
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_99EEECE2_ECCA_47E9_9341_77F7239EB190"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Sitting in the carriage waiting outside, "
"listening to the ⟪k:11⟫pitter patter⟪k:12⟫ of the rain, I gazed out at my two brothers."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫두 형이 준비한 마차에 탄 채――⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫"
"천둥과 빗속에서 ⟪k:13⟫나를 배웅하는 두 형의 얼굴을 보았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_10D7A1F4_5DCA_408C_ABC8_640CB5DF83DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 828bba45c8bb27b3bbff2170f5f827cf79cb8861d6e7c67996e4fdd9f22fd64a
#. default-sha256: 0c36c65d36d4a7dd62a1e7396d77545399eeda7c58ee8e8556cfdc2aa56345eb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_10D7A1F4_5DCA_408C_ABC8_640CB5DF83DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hadn’t seen them in two years, but they hardly looked any different than how I remembered "
"them."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫2년만에 본 형들의 얼굴은 ⟪k:1⟫바뀐 게 없었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2EA95ABB_F168_436E_B99F_3AC93C2BA29A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 821a0f1ee587ff21bfe6f8190fce8a5300d7c4129d7fb3e97caa1249a5a6e72a
#. default-sha256: b5b6a4152ad628f3989dc0feca3608da4426dc7e2f8c5dddb71d96802b46635d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2EA95ABB_F168_436E_B99F_3AC93C2BA29A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was the only one who had changed—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and dramatically, at that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나 혼자만 ⟪k:1⟫크나큰 변모를 이루었다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_0692BDB2_6F38_4DA8_96DC_2DB7EF2CF8FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a363772cbc13162240af62673096cd2addf3aff4d54e928056f15cd02046a551
#. default-sha256: e92e89fc8abbb93b74f333accd7bf72fb3016c97225ae006876a944f6a3e9411
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0692BDB2_6F38_4DA8_96DC_2DB7EF2CF8FF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DCE13B0D_57E6_4B52_AB7E_7C8D7DD09A97
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 279415bd29bd559d5ae8194091efbc0cf8b5f75379bbed7bfcb49ad2a1c6315c
#. default-sha256: 416467a40cc64ca7584d58afee06ef98ca40dc4fecb8efa4357e0d9fd21a1dd6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DCE13B0D_57E6_4B52_AB7E_7C8D7DD09A97"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Looking at them, I couldn’t help but remember the old days.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Playing chess with "
"Didier. Learning to draw from Georges."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫형들의 얼굴을 보니 ⟪k:1⟫절로 과거가 떠올랐다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫디디에와 둔 체스, ⟪k:4⟫조르주에게 배"
"운 그림……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_8D7B438A_C041_426F_B20E_4A9733C9449D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 72f48fe1d0bca37965e1c2794e99833b48188f7b03041d3e1eaa5e52480a94a4
#. default-sha256: 781bed081ec73bb2c6aecd30925ba915797c30ac64c0f0c16c1ddf207507d917
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8D7B438A_C041_426F_B20E_4A9733C9449D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Our sibling outings."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그리고 ⟪k:1⟫셋이서 산책을 나간 기억."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D803BB77_22AB_475F_8509_A45EEB5F5B91
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0750746ede70a419cca7fc2fd05f6baace8643745cf36a1db99b7b51077546d2
#. default-sha256: 5dd993af6296d89b47f891408891a86447deed90fc1b00983dd8d345a8b96e06
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D803BB77_22AB_475F_8509_A45EEB5F5B91"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the ominous sound of thunder crashing in the distance drowned out those memories."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫――하지만 천둥이 치는 밤 시간 정원은 ⟪k:1⟫그런 따스한 나날을 지우려는 것처럼 ⟪k:2⟫불길했다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FCE8D84B_D01C_402F_B4D3_4CC436757271
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35c94b45b5717cda80e654f7f468aed7aaa3cf1e3ab4c3a962f7b9ca9adf1172
#. default-sha256: bc2de94cd3d2343a28acd44b0591e14a62ab982ec39e3d5157ed81a0f2b2d308
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FCE8D84B_D01C_402F_B4D3_4CC436757271"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The mansion is several days’ travel from here.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Hopefully the carriage "
"isn’t too uncomfortable."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫저택은 ⟪k:3⟫여기서 거리가 좀 있어. ⟪k:4⟫며칠 동안은 마차에서 지내야 하지만 ⟪k:5⟫참"
"아 다오."

#: scenario7:scenario7_89F3AA26_DF35_434A_8F40_DF2869E9AD99
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67963c89df162b2ee7cd9d0dfedec1710aced43f0091e7a7d3328cf27d1a291b
#. default-sha256: 2bf0ea6aa3c4527027e168a28f339cf100e6c24c254ac3e7f2d794d415bcecc6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_89F3AA26_DF35_434A_8F40_DF2869E9AD99"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_A9D99D4E_35D3_4074_9B0A_7E5A3AC6A97B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b55358e76b08aebc5950b2d3eb56250d72c12e7e050abab2b35a13235929cc2a
#. default-sha256: 324e99929c29310d7d9ad3cb61eab228499786f72f4feff53eaeec0d1cd71f60
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A9D99D4E_35D3_4074_9B0A_7E5A3AC6A97B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I will send a package with any supplies you need once a month.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Food, "
"clothing... ⟪k:4⟫and, ⟪k:5⟫hmm, ⟪k:6⟫something to pass the time..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫필요한 물자는 ⟪k:2⟫한 달에 한 번씩 ⟪k:3⟫우리가 보내마. ⟪k:4⟫식량과 ⟪k:5⟫의복 등,⟪k:6⟫……"
"다른 건, 그래, ⟪k:7⟫시간을 때울 만한 걸……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_EB5FBF65_86D4_4B41_92C9_567FADCDC9CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67963c89df162b2ee7cd9d0dfedec1710aced43f0091e7a7d3328cf27d1a291b
#. default-sha256: 2bf0ea6aa3c4527027e168a28f339cf100e6c24c254ac3e7f2d794d415bcecc6
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EB5FBF65_86D4_4B41_92C9_567FADCDC9CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_4077FCB7_CA33_461C_927B_AF968C0A6F3F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3b1294d988378045b559356b21cc65326a1971194645d99b55b46b30c611bdf5
#. default-sha256: f67fc616be539c1d67f22f6c5d0671b9feacea889e184b7ae4aa6d46b0651b49
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4077FCB7_CA33_461C_927B_AF968C0A6F3F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If there’s anything you want, Michel, just tell me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Now, ⟪k:4⟫or you can have "
"a servant pass a message on to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫미셸……, ⟪k:2⟫원하는 게 있다면 ⟪k:3⟫얼마든지 말해라. ⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫지금 말해도 되고, ⟪k:6⟫나"
"중에 고용인을 거쳐도 돼."

#: scenario7:scenario7_C2CEF67B_A24F_4EBC_8DC2_CE4EC03D5CB3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c21bfb5f85e0ebc22ad02c967e0735fe59052c12c1072ce117010bf6212ab5df
#. default-sha256: 1f7d330264fdd84505454d8b0ae21b9e729d7a4a1e9fb1576b4e1f737b9bef0e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C2CEF67B_A24F_4EBC_8DC2_CE4EC03D5CB3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I can’t think of— ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Actually, ⟪k:4⟫wait, ⟪k:5⟫I ⟪k:6⟫can⟪k:7⟫ think of one "
"thing.⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫I would like a chess set..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……크게 없습……, ⟪k:2⟫……아니지, ⟪k:3⟫있습니다…….⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫체스판을―― 주십사……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_505C1968_149F_4518_99EF_C72F7BA41284
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 34050dc2e1711eda670c7160a69cae04503a1c0334b112a1f276a5992386a8d4
#. default-sha256: 2a3301c1dbeb590c3b0f14be22ac43a99ed88e0f26416145c436318ee667ad7d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_505C1968_149F_4518_99EF_C72F7BA41284"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫All right. I’ll have one made—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫아아, ⟪k:2⟫그거라면 장인에게 새 걸 만들어 달라――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A699E8CB_FB72_4F79_8085_CB554C20E25D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43e5f51e4c3110f88e78b6139d9f3f5b8d0981287d0f0c4a08bc75b1ff3e9b3c
#. default-sha256: 2ba15c79457ec864ce3407f5cf9d2914cda371f652d855e5a57e27ab72f100ca
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A699E8CB_FB72_4F79_8085_CB554C20E25D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I would rather have... ⟪k:2⟫yours, Didier.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Would that be possible...?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫디디에 형님께서 쓰시던 체스판을…… 주십사 합니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫안 될지요……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_41BD96CA_D881_46D5_A6B2_B6C97E613885
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f69f54486f60184fafd43c8d29959c544bcb53512fe809791825739a35da57b
#. default-sha256: c7c39e8895b7607a97739ac24b8b81a2b2669c51920e5fe0766232832304c16f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_41BD96CA_D881_46D5_A6B2_B6C97E613885"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Are you sure you want that beaten old thing?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……그건 낡은 데다 ⟪k:2⟫흠집도 많은데…… 괜찮겠냐?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_C6A44EC2_D2EC_4509_8D70_4310041CC0E2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 279a8d1993157c130ec332e3fe5898c2f667218c0e40fd5c468accfa1f82ad6b
#. default-sha256: 3ae1c51063d1b2b9cd270b0b2eda47dab439fb126181454063feac4701b30a33
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_C6A44EC2_D2EC_4509_8D70_4310041CC0E2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...Yes, I want that one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫………그게 ⟪k:2⟫좋습니다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_77193580_493C_4B1C_B164_DF42D5A5400F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: faa9ea1a3362b0df34c9d0b5b6a781433b5ae734a697b67cdaee97b6f2e3b3b4
#. default-sha256: eb3a39b0b9f0dcf8c2e7f2607b548157fd22f171db7bc74786db55f5dfcfe39d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_77193580_493C_4B1C_B164_DF42D5A5400F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫...All right, then. I’ll include it in the first delivery."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……그러냐. ⟪k:2⟫알았다. ⟪k:3⟫그럼 첫 물자에 넣어 두마."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FD276F4D_E5F0_4568_95EC_1F7EC24345C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ba897c57d4424295a1f735e0744ca2725d7fede93c17b7662ff7b721a39596bc
#. default-sha256: 520512adb724a897a40825943305750ee8f55f5536efcd3037cf809a19c091c7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FD276F4D_E5F0_4568_95EC_1F7EC24345C0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I’ll send you something too, Michel.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Anything you want, just tell me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫얘 미셸, ⟪k:4⟫나도 뭐 보낼게. ⟪k:5⟫뭐가 좋아? ⟪k:6⟫말만 해 봐."

#: scenario7:scenario7_AC12B8FE_305D_44C1_8A8C_2B831305A787
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08a892089c820adbcdd6f7d754dda03f9583727dbffbf27b891b42d2aab58ed7
#. default-sha256: dcdcab88a5b19f2d2ac41254f8259f3873398cebd281e6effe7f3b5a586ed38c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AC12B8FE_305D_44C1_8A8C_2B831305A787"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫In that case... ⟪k:5⟫I would like some art tools.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"I’m nowhere near as much of an artist as you are,⟪k:8⟫Georges, so they don’t have to be anything "
"special."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………. ⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그럼 ⟪k:4⟫그림을 그릴 도구를……. ⟪k:5⟫형님처럼 잘 그리진 않으니…… 간단한 "
"거면 됩니다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6B063F2C_3FEE_4909_821D_945E81EB97D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08adc1f5d11bf65db4e4e6dd6b7e37593500288b5a31079080b6387fb52092e5
#. default-sha256: 8655ce12dd36de223bd04527f7c27e04516a2c7a332bf791ba76406f8b98f9e4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6B063F2C_3FEE_4909_821D_945E81EB97D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Gotcha. So some canvas and, ⟪k:2⟫hmm... ⟪k:3⟫how ’bout some charcoal?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫And when "
"you’re back, I want to see what you’ve made with it, okay?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫그래, ⟪k:2⟫그럼 캔버스가 될 거랑…… 목탄이면 되나.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫뭐 완성하면―― 미셸이 돌아올 "
"때여도 되니까 ⟪k:5⟫보여 줘."

#: scenario7:scenario7_773BFE2C_EEBA_4DAA_89F6_C6732E4E9AA9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e9700a396384db1e2476ba3b5a7665809d7c30682b92541c764319c411935b3c
#. default-sha256: 0b02f17ee9d31c8260166eccec52b71e1b86c2566bd61c8a795cd003e4d26b3a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_773BFE2C_EEBA_4DAA_89F6_C6732E4E9AA9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Okay."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……그러겠습니다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_1A34B477_352D_4260_8109_F961EDAD8409
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8fadfb5ffdfd9ed9f7bb325c3a416cb6f3839c879e0d489f1846bd2c3d66bae
#. default-sha256: 78d7983b0019d19db5a3084bb8cc6115cf10e32da931cd495113f02fabdb950a
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_1A34B477_352D_4260_8109_F961EDAD8409"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I know this is already hard enough on you, Michel...⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫but I need "
"to ask you to do something for me.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Avoid making contact with anyone who doesn’t already "
"know about you."
msgstr ""
